  "name": "IEEE 57-bus grid",
  "source": "MATPOWER case57.m (https://github.com/MATPOWER/matpower/blob/master/data/case57.m), converted from the public IEEE Common Data Format file in the UW Power Systems Test Case Archive (https://labs.ece.uw.edu/pstca/).",
